{{Classic Era}}

New Sebilis Expedition looks to be little more than a door on the side of a hill, and it would be easy to miss if it weren't for the nearby tents and shipwrecks. However, a new city lies underground, as the Iksar have carved out a place to live and the roots are still hanging from the ceilings. Most of the inhabitants are busy, spell vendors selling wares, guildmasters recruiting near the entrance, and very few guards. Makes one wonder where all the Troopers are currently?  Just beyond the city are underground caverns with monsters to kill, with several unique items.
