== Surrounding Areas ==

The underground area is near the shore in the North Western area of The Northern Desert of Ro, on the other side from East Commons tunnel. The nearby shipwrecks don't seem to hold any secrets. There are a few Troopers stationed outside along with a vendor and soulbinder for any travelers to take advantage of.

== Travelling To and From New Cabilis Expedition ==

There's only one way in and one way out of the New Cabilis Expedition and that is [[The Northern Desert of Ro]].

== History ==

The history of the New Cabilis Expedition is just beginning.

What more will we discover?

== Local Color ==

''' Places '''

The inside looks very spartan: the new underground home still shows roots through the ceilings, the guild areas are small stations with a bed and desk. Great care was taken to preserve their massive collection of books - book cases decorate every room.

''' People '''

The Iksars of New Sebilis Expedition are happy with their newfound home near The Norther Desert of Ro.

